## Environment Files: `dev.tfvars`

```hcl
environment            = "dev"
aws_region             = "us-east-1"
s3_bucket_name         = "my-app-assets-dev"
rds_instance_class     = "db.t3.micro"
rds_allocated_storage  = 20
rds_username           = "postgres"
# Use `terraform var.rds_password` prompt or pass via -var
rds_multi_az           = false
rds_backup_retention_days = 7
service_account_name   = "my-app-svc"
enable_s3_replication  = false
```

